B.fGH=new A.e6("copper","Copper price",'The price of copper futures in dollars per pound. Copper goes into wiring, construction and machines, so it is nicknamed "Dr. Copper" for its read on global growth.',"Industrial demand is firm, especially from China, or supply is tight.","Industrial demand is weakening \u2014 an early hint of slower global growth.","Copper rising \u2014 industrial demand firm.","Copper falling \u2014 industrial demand softening.","At {v}, copper is within its ordinary range.","At {v}, copper is unusually high or low against its history.","At {v}, copper is at an extreme of its history.",B.cgF,B.d0M,"Miners, industrials, and commodity-exporting countries.",B.cMs,B.ay0)
