B.fHs=new A.e6("cugold","Copper \xf7 gold ratio","Copper futures divided by gold futures. Copper stands for industrial growth, gold for safety, so the ratio is a quick read on growth appetite.","Growth appetite is rising: industrial demand firm relative to safety demand. It often moves with the 10-year yield.","Safety is preferred over growth: it often falls with yields in slowdown scares.","Growth appetite rising vs safety.","Safety demand rising vs growth.",u.h,u.s,u.Q,B.cvJ,B.cgh,"Cyclicals, miners and banks track the growth side; defensives the safety side.",B.d98,B.d8p)
