B.bJu=new A.pR("h1","First light","Peaceful ground. Place Wells, draw edges, close your first loop.",1,4000,0,150,800,600,B.arB,3,"Tap open ground to place two Wells near your core, then drag from one shape to another to draw an edge. Close the triangle core \u2192 Well \u2192 Well \u2192 core and the space inside becomes yours.")
B.bJp=new A.pR("h2","Golden ground","Still peaceful. Loops of Wells pay flux by their area \u2014 grow.",1,15e3,0,160,1000,700,B.arB,-1,"A loop of Wells is a POWER field \u2014 it pays flux for every unit of area it encloses. Chain new loops off your old ones: a shared edge is ground you never pay for twice.")
B.asd=s([3,1],t.t)
B.bJm=new A.pR("h3","Shards","The first foes: fast darts that saw through your edges.",0,2,2,200,1000,700,B.asd,1,"Shards are fast darts that saw through your edges. Place Spikes near your lines \u2014 they shoot anything in range.")
B.bJj=new A.pR("h4","The kill field","Loops can fight too. Orbs join in \u2014 they ram your shapes.",0,4,4,200,1000,700,B.asd,-1,"A loop with mostly Spikes becomes a KILL field that burns every foe inside it. Ring the approach to your core \u2014 Orbs ram shapes directly from the third wave.")
B.a0k=s([3,1,2],t.t)
B.bJt=new A.pR("h5","Anchors","Cheap, tough, structural \u2014 the square holds the wall.",0,5,5,210,1000,700,B.a0k,2,"Anchors are cheap and tough \u2014 the corners of your cheapest loops. Stretch your territory with them and save the flux for guns.")
B.bJq=new A.pR("h6","Bastion","Wall the core: something heavy leads the sixth wave.",0,6,6,220,1000,700,B.a0k,-1,"A loop with mostly Anchors is a BASTION \u2014 its whole ring, nodes and edges, takes half damage. Wall the core before the sixth wave: the Mass grinds straight for it.")
B.bJs=new A.pR("h7","Claim under fire","Territory wins this one \u2014 grow your claim while waves keep coming.",1,12e3,-1,220,1000,700,B.a0k,-1,"This one is won by AREA, not by outlasting waves. Push loops outward behind bastion walls and keep drawing.")
B.bJn=new A.pR("h8","Prisms","The amplifier arrives: hexagons make everything nearby stronger.",0,7,7,240,1000,700,B.oN,4,"A loop with mostly Prisms is RESONANT \u2014 every field sharing a corner with it works half again as hard. Weave one between your power and kill fields.")
B.bJw=new A.pR("h9","Resonance","A big claim under constant pressure \u2014 make the geometry sing.",1,24e3,-1,240,1200,820,B.oN,-1,"Chain resonant loops through your territory: boosted power fields fund boosted kill fields. Claim the target area while the waves keep coming.")
B.bJx=new A.pR("h10","The long watch","Nine waves. The Mass leads every third one from the sixth.",0,9,9,240,1000,700,B.oN,-1,"The Mass crushes nodes and edges alike and only stops when it or your core is gone. Layer kill fields on its path and bastion the inner ring.")
B.bJk=new A.pR("h11","Thin flux","Nearly broke. Earn your territory one bounty at a time.",1,15e3,-1,130,1000,700,B.oN,-1,"You start nearly broke \u2014 one small Well loop is all you can afford. Grow income first; every kill pays a bounty too.")
B.bJi=new A.pR("h12","The broad plane","A huge plane, a huge claim. Make the frontier pay for itself.",1,36e3,-1,260,1300,880,B.oN,-1,"Big loops pay best \u2014 chain outward and let resonance carry the frontier. The waves never stop, so neither should the drawing.")
B.bJv=new A.pR("h13","Deep grind","Twelve waves, three Masses. Hold, rebuild, hold again.",0,12,12,260,1200,820,B.oN,-1,"Twelve waves and a Mass on every third from the sixth. Bastion the inner ring and rebuild fast between waves.")
B.bJl=new A.pR("h14","Perfect form","The finale. Fifteen waves \u2014 everything the plane can throw.",0,15,15,280,1300,880,B.oN,-1,"Fifteen waves of everything at once. Balance income, walls, guns and resonance \u2014 and keep the core standing.")
