B.fiS=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_prv1","wfp_legend","This map is 59 nodes and 60 edges, derived BY HAND on 2026-08-18 by reading the code - isan at origin/dev ff89793, flutterboard, isa_kit, datakit, the server hooks folder and DATA_SOURCES.md.","text",70,552,900,40,10,12],t.M)
B.fiU=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_prv2","wfp_legend","The canonical inventory is an internal data-flow map document. The same graph is also drawn as a bublie board (Files > Ecosystem > Data flow), so the two renditions of one inventory can be compared side by side.","text",70,600,900,56,10,12],t.M)
B.fiW=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_dec1","wfp_legend","NOTHING DERIVES THIS AUTOMATICALLY, SO IT DECAYS. No test watches the real architecture and updates these boxes, and editing the inventory doc does not move them either.","text",70,672,900,40,10,12],t.M)
B.fiO=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_dec2","wfp_legend","Re-verify before trusting it - the doc carries a six-step checklist: applet count, the sink list and its order, the server hook count, the DATA_SOURCES row count, and whether web storage is still IndexedDB-primary.","text",70,720,900,40,10,12],t.M)
B.fiR=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_dec3","wfp_legend","Deriving it once already corrected five things the fleet had been repeating that the code does not support, including that web persistence is IndexedDB and not localStorage.","text",70,768,900,40,10,12],t.M)
B.fiX=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_out1","wfp_legend","DELIBERATELY LEFT OUT: the designed-but-unbuilt seams S1-S5; the auth and session path; all 68 applets individually; the note lazy-decode internals; the algamesh protocol internals; and any server address, credential or real user row.","text",70,826,900,56,10,12],t.M)
B.fiQ=new A.b(B.nx,["wfx_leg_out2","wfp_legend","This is a map of the plumbing, not of anyone's data.","text",70,890,900,24,10,12],t.M)
