B.hoQ=new A.L("Up under 0.5 pp vs a year ago","Stable (calm).")
B.hrB=new A.L("Up 0.5 to 1.0 pp","Softening (watch).")
B.huG=new A.L("Up 1.0 pp or more","Recession-type deterioration (stress).")
B.hmb=new A.L("The level itself","Depends on the era; the direction of change is the useful signal.")
