B.f6I=new A.b(B.h,["No single indicator calls every crisis, but stress tends to show up in several places before it reaches stock prices: credit spreads, the VIX term structure, regional banks, copper vs gold, the dollar and unemployment. Six equal votes make the composite; the strategy enters above +20 and only exits below 0, so one noisy gauge cannot flip it back and forth."],t.w)
