B.fef=new A.b(B.h,["Weighted mean of five parts, each scaled to \u22121..+1: relative strength (13w \xf7 10%, 26w \xf7 15%), 12-1 momentum \xf7 25%, trend (\xb11), near-high (0% = +1, 20% below = \u22121), calm (0% = +1, 40% a year = \u22121). You can change the weights in Edit scan."],t.w)
