B.eFH=new A.b(B.h,['Trend state = up (above the 40-week average and positive 12-1 momentum), down (below and negative) or mixed. Count past weeks in the current state whose N-week window had finished by the latest bar; share that ended higher, with a Wilson 95% range. "No edge" when fewer than 30 cases or the range includes 50%.'],t.w)
B.f8g=new A.b(B.h,["Back-to-back windows overlap, so the range is sized on the independent windows (n \xf7 horizon), and an edge needs at least 10 of them. Most assets drift up over time, so a rate above 50% is not by itself an edge."],t.w)
