B.h5X=new A.C("viewTable",B.b1,'Sheet mode, opt-in PERSISTED per-sheet view: the table whose row id is the active scope value of `scopeColumn` (e.g. `worksheets`). Its `viewColumn` holds JSON {cw:{<col>:px}, dw, dh, fr, fc, af:"A1:D40", afArrows}; column drags and freeze changes write it back (one undo step). Absent = view state stays in memory.',B.k,null,!1)
