B.fT8=new A.C("agenciesTable",B.b1,"Opt-in user-editable table (Settings \u2192 Data sources) of transit agencies. When set, the USER OWNS the agency list: it wins over both the spec's static `agencies` and the server `configUrl`.",B.k,null,!1)
