B.h4a=new A.C("column",B.K,'Column holding the Markdown text (default "body"). The cell is read on EVERY build, so a host that rewrites the content under a stable row id (a single scratch row reused per article) always re-renders \u2014 this node keeps no copy that could go stale.',B.k,null,!1)
