B.fws=new A.dv("report",'A configurable report workbench: filters/sorts/limit over a bound table, a grouped bar chart with optional %-difference vs a base series (built for comparing model runs), a group-by pivot table with sum/avg/median/count rollups, and saved view "slices" persisted as rows. Capabilities toggle via tools.',B.d3L,!1)
