B.h7H=new A.C("format",B.bU,'Format each bar\'s end-of-bar value label: currency (grouped with a symbol), percent (x100 + %), compact (1.2K/3.4M/5.6B \u2014 the same formatter `stat.format:"compact"` uses), or number (thousands-grouped). Unset = the legacy raw-number rendering. Use compact when values can reach 6+ digits \u2014 the label column has fixed width and a long raw number can wrap/clip.',B.d2P,null,!1)
