B.h1W=new A.C("format",B.bU,'Format the big number: currency (grouped with a symbol), percent (x100 + %), compact (1.2K/3.4M), relative (with agg min/max over an ISO-8601 `valueColumn`, shows the earliest/latest stamp humanized as "3m ago"/"2h ago"/"3d ago"), number (thousands-grouped), duration (seconds \u2192 "3d 4h 12m"; see `inputUnit`), or epochSeconds / epochMillis (a Unix timestamp \u2192 localized device-time-zone text; see `style` \u2014 e.g. agg max over a timestamp column = "last seen"). Unset = raw.',B.ddl,null,!1)
