B.fwf=new A.dv("draw",'Vector drawing on stacked LAYERS (add/show-hide/reorder/rename per layer, each with a blend mode + opacity): freehand pen + shapes (line/arrow/rect/ellipse) + a text tool + a Select tool (drag a region \u2192 "Copy region"); hold Shift to snap lines to horizontal/vertical/45\xb0 and shapes to square/circle. A layer can also be an ADJUSTMENT (brightness/contrast/warmth/saturation/grayscale grade applied to everything below it). Paste a clipboard image (\u2318/Ctrl+V) \u2014 it floats movably, then bakes into the active layer on the first mark. \u2318/Ctrl+C copies the composited image. One finger draws, two fingers (or the wheel) pan & zoom. PNG export.',B.czH,!1)
