B.fuZ=new A.dv("tickgrid","Week tick grid (habit tracker): one line per row of `table` \xd7 the 7 days of the week holding `$day:<settingKey>`; tapping a cell adds or deletes a tick row in `ticksTable` (refColumn = the row id, dateColumn = yyyy-MM-dd). Localized weekday initials, today's column highlighted, 44px rows, fits a 390px phone.",B.cJN,!1)
