B.fwk=new A.dv("recordpage",'The page of one record of a record type (e.g. a Person): round initials avatar + full name, a label/value row per field ("add" when empty), YOUR FIELDS (fields the user added; type-wide, then this record\'s own), and "+ Add field". Esc / x / back ask "Save changes?" when edited; Cmd/Ctrl+S saves. Seeds the type on first open and splits old full names into the name parts.',B.cRf,!1)
