B.fZu=new A.C("carry",B.a_,"Opt-in carry-through (carry-1108): { startColumn?, doneColumn?, doneAtColumn?, skipIf?: [columns], filter?, label? } or true. An undone row with a start date shows on every day from it on; once done, from start to the doneAt day (no doneAt: the start day only). A set skipIf column (e.g. a time, a repeat) or a row outside filter keeps its own day. Shows a read-only Active span and Done date under the title band for a row that carries.",B.k,null,!1)
B.h7T=new A.C("openAction",B.a_,"Opt-in (ndscreens-1110): the action spec that opens a tapped subtask as its own task view (fired with {table, id}); e.g. selectRow + goto. Without it the subtask opens in place.",B.k,null,!1)
B.fZp=new A.C("notesColumn",B.K,"Opt-in (ndnotes-1109): a multi-line Notes field under the title meta, saved with the page. Shown as text with tappable http(s) links (linkify); a tap elsewhere edits at that spot.",B.k,null,!1)
