B.fYa=new A.C("titleLink",B.ab,"Default true (ndnotes-1109): when the title holds a web link, a small open-link button follows the title field.",B.k,null,!1)
B.hgf=new A.C("subtasks",B.a_,'Opt-in subtasks (ndnotes-1109): true or { parentColumn? (default parentId), titleColumn?, doneColumn?, orderColumn?, values?: {\u2026written on each new subtask}, promoteValues?: {\u2026written when reparent makes one top-level}, parentFilter? }. A subtask is a row of the same table whose parentColumn names a live row passing parentFilter, or a subtask itself (ndfix-1110: nesting is unlimited; done/total counts direct subtasks).  The page shows a checklist under Notes (+ Add subtask, tick, rename, remove \u2014 written live); Delete takes the subtasks too, as one undo step. njnest-1111: placement? "end" puts the list at the end of the settings panel; heading? (localizable, "{n}" = count) titles it; addLabel? (localizable) names the add line.',B.k,null,!1)
