B.fv4=new A.dv("taskedit","A full-screen edit page for one existing row, built from the same rows as a composer drawer (draftOptions shape), bound to the row. Header: \xd7 Close without saving (asks when changed) at the left, Save at the right (writes only what changed, then steps back; Cmd/Ctrl+S does the same). Title band: done checkbox + a full-width title field. Settings panel: every option, always open (two columns when wide), then a Delete row. A duration option drives the row's live countdown (\u25b6 / pause, stop, reset); a startNow option becomes Tracked (total, start/stop, + Add time).",B.cSO,!1)
