B.fvb=new A.dv("dataancestor",'CONTROL block, renders nothing: derives a synthetic ANCESTOR-REFERENCE column on `table` by walking CONTAINS edges up from each row to its nearest ancestor of `ancestorType` (e.g. a Dispatch sub-project nested under its parent project). Registers an AncestorProjection on the board (the same idiom datanow uses for its live-status column) so every visibleRows read gains the column with zero renderer changes \u2014 declare it `type: reference, refTable: <table>` in columns.json and `cards.groupBy: "<column>"` groups rows into per-ancestor sections, showing the ancestor\'s title as the group header.',B.dgH,!1)
